  +:ld(Ada, up)
  +:angry(Carnold)
  Carnold: "It's clear you don't really get it."
  Carnold: "That's fine, you'll understand in due time."
  +:exclaim(Carnold)
  Carnold: "But goodness!  I believe I have forgotten something rather important."
  +none()
  +walkToMarker(Carnold, MarkerCarnoldWalk1)
  +panCameraRelativeToCurrentPosition(0, 20)
  +:leach(Carnold, Conscience)
  +lookAtCharacter(Ada, Carnold)
  Carnold: "<cascade>You must be the fabled <color=ORANGE>Conscience<cascade> I've heard so much about."
  Carnold: "I hope you can forgive my rudeness in ignoring your presence until now."
  Conscience: "Oh, don't worry about it."
  +:ld(Conscience, leftdown)
  Conscience: "Happens all the time."
  +:ld(Conscience, leftup)
  Carnold: "At any rate, it's a pleasure to meet you!"
  +:teardrop(Conscience)
  Conscience: "Um.  Nice to meet you too, I guess?"
  Conscience: "I already know who you are, so really, it's a one-way greeting. But 'hello' anyways."
  +:happy(Carnold)
  Carnold: "Yes, of course!  I'm sure <color=ORANGE>Adalais</> has spoken <italic>all</> about me."
  +walkToOffset(Carnold, -8, 0)
  Carnold: "It's truly unfortunate that the only way I can interact with you is through a <color=LIGHTBLUE>Revirtualis</> such as this."
  +:question(Ada)
  Ada: "Is that what you really wanted?  To speak with <color=ORANGE>Conscience</>?"
  Ada: "You could have done that at <color=LIGHTBLUE>Revirtualis</> in <color=LIGHTPURPLE>Erran Valley</>, provided of course, that you asked nicely."
  +lookAtCharacter(Carnold, Ada)
  +:serious(Carnold)
  Carnold: "I'd be lying if I said that wasn't part of the reason.  You have to admit that she is quite interesting indeed."
// Carnold examines Conscience.
  Carnold: "<cascade>However there's <color=LIGHTRED>much<cascade> more that I want from you."
  +:ld(Carnold, rightdown)
  Carnold: "And also, for that matter, of <color=ORANGE>her</>."
  +:ld(Carnold, right)
  Carnold: "It just so happens that this particular <color=LIGHTBLUE>Revirtualis</>, this particular <italic>shard</>, is what I require in order to get it."
  +:shakeZ(Ada)
  Ada: "Just tell me what it is so I can get on my way!"
// +setAnimation(Carnold, ch_carl-arnold_thoughtful);
// +:serious(Carnold);
// Carnold: "<cascade>I notice you didn't say 'we'.  Is <color=ORANGE>Conscience</> inferred to be with you all the time?"
// +:teardrop(Ada);
// Ada: "<cascade-letters>......"
