  +none()
  +setAnimationState(Carnold, idle)
// +:minorPause();
  +walkToMarker(Carnold, MarkerCarnoldWalk2)
  +:leach(Carnold, Conscience)
  +:ld(Ada, leftup)
  +panCameraRelativeToCurrentPosition(0, -10)
  Carnold: "I'm sure you've seen by now.  But the <color=LIGHTBLUE>Revirtualis</> that <color=LIGHTBLUE>this arcade</> is able to render is quite advanced."
  +:minorPause()
  +setAnimation(Carnold, ch_carl-arnold_gesture_right)
  +:shakeZ(Carnold)
  Carnold: "It appears we are adrift in the void of space. And yet--"
  +none()
  +:minorPause()
  +setAnimation(Carnold, ch_carl-arnold_snap_right)
  +waitMS(100)
  +playSound(snap)
  +waitMS(100)
// +changePropAnim(PropTree, tree1_anim, 0, 0);
  +createPropAtMarker(PropTree, MarkerTree, tree1, 0, 0)
  +playSound(spawn_enemy)
  +spawnParticleAtMarker(EFFECT_TEMPLATE_SPAWN, MarkerTree, 'normal', 0, 0)
  +waitMS(500)
  +:ld(Carnold, right)
  Carnold: "Lo!  A tree hath appeared!"
  Carnold: "I've prepared this little patch of grass just for the occasion.  A little bit of life in the desolate landscape of space."
  +setAnimationState(Carnold, idle)
  Carnold: "With some knowledge, I am able to specify that this lovely tree should grow right in this spot."
  +:flat(Ada)
  Ada: "You prepared this spot to place a tree just to show it to <italic>me?"
  Ada: "This is a virtual world.  Could you not just make anything appear here?"
  Carnold: "Not quite anything; there are rules in this world, just like there are rules in 'real' life."
  Carnold: "It's just... in here the rules aren't quite the same as the ones outside of the <color=LIGHTBLUE>Revirtualis</>."
  +:shakeZ(Carnold)
  Carnold: "I have been a proponent of the <color=ORANGE>Regem Ludos Arcade</> since its very inception."
  Carnold: "For so long I, alone, have owned the majority of the high scores in this arcade."
  Carnold: "As such, I am alloted a <color=LIGHTBLUE>special status</>."
  +none()
  +setAnimation(Carnold, ch_carl-arnold_hands_on_hips)
  +:jump(Carnold)
  Carnold: "I am, the <color=ORANGE scale=1.5 cascade=250>King of Games</>."
  Carnold: "I can control so much of this shard.  This tree is one such example."
  +setAnimationState(Carnold, idle)
  +:ld(Carnold, right)
  Carnold: "You see, <italic color=ORANGE>Adalais</>, just like you are recognized for your supposed 'greatness' outside, I am recognized for mine in here."
  +:ld(Carnold, down)
  Carnold: "The only difference is, my greatness is <italic>earned."
  Carnold: "And yours is unfairly inherited by your <color=LIGHTPURPLE>infamous father</>."
  Carnold: "I can prove it."
  +none()
